      "worked": "For $\\cos\\theta\\ne0$,\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2-xy+1&=(\\sec\\theta+\\tan\\theta)^2-2\\sec\\theta(\\sec\\theta+\\tan\\theta)+1\\\\x^2-xy+1&=\\sec^2\\theta+2\\sec\\theta\\tan\\theta+\\tan^2\\theta-2\\sec^2\\theta-2\\sec\\theta\\tan\\theta+1\\\\x^2-xy+1&=\\tan^2\\theta-\\sec^2\\theta+1\\\\x^2-xy+1&=0.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
